      "Link the WhatsApp account once by pairing code or QR before launching. No API key."
    ]
  },
  "clients": [
    "Claude Code",
    "Claude Desktop",
    "any stdio MCP client (protocol 2025-11-25 and 2026-07-28)."
  ],
